oordinates\">X:&nbsp;80&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;27</span></li>\n<li>Found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Murder Tribunal</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Odd Valros' deluxe hardwood coffins will preserve corpses from rats and maggots for up to three times longer than any competitors! Choose Valros, because the end is always near!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1071/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11029/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3075/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 17/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 754963/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.551      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   36.551      1 -total\n 32.12%   11.741      5 Template:Icon_text\n 26.01%    9.507      1 Template:Main_only\n 24.02%    8.779     11 Template:Trim\n 16.85%    6.158      1 Template:Books\n 15.77%    5.763      1 Template:Icon_link\n 12.56%    4.591      5 Template:Ifempty\n 11.11%    4.060      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.88%    3.977      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34293-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202058 and revision id 256880. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}